    :b-where-the-categorical-outcome-comes-from "The observation pass decides it from the chosen mission's own :open-hole-count on the two records (holes/labs/wm-contract/wm_step_observe.bb), strictly down => :grounded-change, from the closed vocabulary at src/futon2/aif/full_loop_cohort.clj:31. MISSION-SCOPED ON PURPOSE: the step world record is repo-wide (:world/commit-census, :world/files, :world/mana-age) and moves when anyone commits anything, so reading an outcome off it would attribute an operator's commit to the machine's chosen action. The world delta is recorded on the observation as context and is explicitly not its basis."
